# Playwright artefacts written by tests/e2e/playwright.config.ts.
#
# The repo-root .gitignore already carries `/playwright-report/` and
# `/test-results/`, but both are ROOT-ANCHORED and therefore do not match the
# `tests/e2e/…` locations this config writes to. Committed here BEFORE the
# artefacts can appear, so a CI run's report can never be accidentally staged.
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Storage states minted by global-setup.ts (admin + the rbac-* fixture users).
# Also covered by the root .gitignore's `tests/e2e/.auth/`; repeated so this
# directory is self-contained.
.auth/
